meta {
  name: Invite links - Join
  type: http
  seq: 227
}

post {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/invite-links/<token of the link>/membership
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  Joins the community of an invite link (#1391), as a member, with the access groups and the member tags of the link. Needs a verified email address. A member gets 422 "You are already a member of this community", a person whom a manager removed 422 with the text of the block: nothing changes for them. A link that does not work gives the 404 of the read. Returns 201 with the community as a member sees it. Limited per minute, with the joins of open communities. Token ability: communities:write.
}
